        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Brass Accents Decorative Gothic Church Push Plate 3-3/8\" Wide x 18\" High</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis decorative Gothic church push plate from the Brass Accents Renaissance Collection is highly detailed solid cast brass. Created in the Sargent & Company Belfort pattern, circa 1894, a Gothic church design popular at the turn of the 20th century.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBrass Accents provides distinctive craftsmanship with old-world tradition for a lifetime of elegance, hand finished in the USA. They are one of the worlds leading crafters of decorative hot-forged  and cast brass door hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <b>Matching <a href=\"/products/gothic-church-solid-brass-pull-plate-with-8-1-2-inch-handle-brass-accents-a04-p5841\">Decorative Gothic Church Pull Plate</a>\r\n</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Brass Accents A04-P5840 Gothic Church Push Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 3-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Cast Brass</li>\r\n<li><b>Finish Warranty: 10 Years</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nComes complete with matching finish mounting screws for easy installation. Hand rubbed and finished in the USA with a 10 year warranty.\r\n</p>",
